{
  "_doc": "Group Rivalry System (0.6). Every number the rivalry engine uses is here: doctrine weights, leader trait modifiers and their bounds, what each kind of event does to a relationship, favor statuses and milestones, alliance terms, strategic actions with their costs, risks and cooldowns, and the adaptation rules. rivalry.RivalryEngine reads this once; nothing below is repeated as a literal in code. Factions are keyed by the rivalry names (mercenaries, government, loners, bandits); gameKey is the faction key the rest of the game uses.",

